1
00:00:41,560 --> 00:00:43,200
All the rules are broken.

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:46,359
Times have really changed.

3
00:00:46,640 --> 00:00:47,560
Changed my ass.

4
00:00:48,039 --> 00:00:49,920
Some things never change.

5
00:00:51,359 --> 00:00:52,719
What are you afraid of?

6
00:00:53,640 --> 00:00:55,880
We've got people up top protecting us.

7
00:00:56,039 --> 00:00:58,200
We always manage to dodge the bullet, right?

8
00:01:00,079 --> 00:01:02,039
We don't even know who's protecting us.

9
00:01:02,039 --> 00:01:03,000
Now that Guanhong went down,

10
00:01:03,039 --> 00:01:03,880
who's gonna look out for us?

11
00:01:08,159 --> 00:01:09,200
He can't see a thing anymore.

12
00:01:10,560 --> 00:01:12,079
He should've retired a long time ago.

13
00:01:13,599 --> 00:01:15,480
Times are changing too fast.

14
00:01:16,040 --> 00:01:18,640
Is there still a place for us in Gangcheng?

15
00:01:19,879 --> 00:01:23,239
The people backing us only want money.

16
00:01:24,680 --> 00:01:26,120
Not Xie Guanhong.

17
00:01:26,200 --> 00:01:27,719
Anyone else would be the same.

18
00:01:28,319 --> 00:01:29,840
It's not that Gangcheng has no place for us.

19
00:01:30,040 --> 00:01:31,719
We're the ones who chickened out.

20
00:01:35,239 --> 00:01:36,000
Who's there?

21
00:01:38,200 --> 00:01:40,480
Xie Guanhong, you have the nerve to show up?

22
00:01:40,519 --> 00:01:43,519
How did Heyisheng end up with scum like you?

23
00:01:44,079 --> 00:01:45,599
We treated you like a brother.

24
00:01:45,799 --> 00:01:47,200
What do you take us for?

25
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:48,799
Stabbing us in the back like this?

26
00:01:49,359 --> 00:01:50,239
Playing such a dangerous game.

27
00:01:50,319 --> 00:01:51,120
What do we do now?

28
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:52,480
How are you gonna clean this up?

29
00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:54,480
Keep your voices down!

30
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:57,959
Get too worked up and you'll all meet your maker!

31
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:00,239
You're the biggest bastard of all!

32
00:02:00,680 --> 00:02:01,760
The cops are outside.

33
00:02:17,400 --> 00:02:18,280
You called the cops!

34
00:02:18,520 --> 00:02:20,319
You sold us out from the very start, didn't you?

35
00:02:28,960 --> 00:02:30,080
Are you crazy?!

36
00:02:30,159 --> 00:02:31,719
Are you dragging us down to die with you?

37
00:02:31,879 --> 00:02:35,199
Even if I die today, I'll kill you first!

38
00:02:36,840 --> 00:02:37,840
Calm down!

39
00:02:38,280 --> 00:02:40,800
If you make a move now, the cops will see!

40
00:02:43,080 --> 00:02:45,159
I think we'd better get out of here.

41
00:02:45,520 --> 00:02:47,400
This is a trap.

42
00:02:48,439 --> 00:02:49,479
Yeah.

43
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:50,719
We really screwed up this time.

44
00:02:50,719 --> 00:02:51,759
Shut up!

45
00:03:01,800 --> 00:03:03,280
I didn't bring the cops here.

46
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:05,960
I didn't sell out Heyisheng.

47
00:03:19,280 --> 00:03:20,800
I can give up being the Dragon Head,

48
00:03:21,280 --> 00:03:23,039
and I don't even need the Dragon Head Baton.

49
00:03:24,280 --> 00:03:26,360
But we brothers must stand united!

50
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:28,400
And point our guns at the enemy!

51
00:03:29,639 --> 00:03:30,800
At the enemy?

52
00:03:31,240 --> 00:03:33,039
The cops are right outside!

53
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:35,840
I don't even have a piece!

54
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:37,479
Fight them my ass!

55
00:03:37,879 --> 00:03:39,360
In this world,

56
00:03:39,759 --> 00:03:42,479
there's nothing money and guns can't solve.

57
00:03:52,400 --> 00:03:53,280
Either

58
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:56,840
we stay trapped in a cage like that bird,

59
00:03:57,400 --> 00:04:00,319
or we fight our way out head-on!

60
00:04:01,479 --> 00:04:03,240
A man dies, but his name lives on.

61
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:05,000
And earn our last shred of dignity.

62
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:08,080
Be a man, or be a bird...

63
00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:09,759
Or be a bird-man.

64
00:04:10,719 --> 00:04:11,840
You choose.

65
00:04:14,159 --> 00:04:15,120
Everyone, get ready.

66
00:04:15,159 --> 00:04:16,439
Three, two, one.

67
00:04:17,920 --> 00:04:18,759
What are you doing?

68
00:04:19,079 --> 00:04:20,279
I'm the Commander!

69
00:04:20,519 --> 00:04:22,639
Remember, you're a cop.

70
00:04:23,319 --> 00:04:24,399
And your brother's death...

71
00:04:24,439 --> 00:04:25,560
I didn't want it to happen!

72
00:04:26,519 --> 00:04:28,040
Don't bring up my brother!

73
00:04:29,360 --> 00:04:31,920
My brother died in your Anti-Triad Unit.

74
00:04:32,079 --> 00:04:33,279
Isn't that right?!

75
00:04:34,800 --> 00:04:35,279
Move out!

76
00:04:37,639 --> 00:04:40,399
If I'd known it'd come to this, I would've retired long ago.

77
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:42,319
To think Old Blind Man

78
00:04:42,519 --> 00:04:44,680
would actually get his hands on the Dragon Head Baton.

79
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:47,519
It's finally in my hands.

80
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:42,800
Get down!

81
00:06:09,879 --> 00:06:10,680
Go!

82
00:06:46,920 --> 00:06:47,720
Hurry, get upstairs!

83
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:58,120
Dad!

84
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:02,399
Dad, what's wrong?

85
00:07:05,199 --> 00:07:05,959
What's wrong, Dad?

86
00:07:05,959 --> 00:07:07,000
What happened?

87
00:07:08,480 --> 00:07:09,240
Answer me!

88
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:10,360
Dad, what's going on outside?

89
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:14,959
What the hell is going on?

90
00:07:14,959 --> 00:07:15,680
Dad!

91
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:17,439
Why do you have a gun?

92
00:07:17,720 --> 00:07:18,600
Dad!

93
00:07:19,319 --> 00:07:20,759
You can't kill anyone else!

94
00:07:23,040 --> 00:07:25,480
You really can't kill anyone else, Dad!

95
00:07:42,600 --> 00:07:44,120
Cherish the time you have left.

96
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:53,600
Trust me.

97
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:15,160
Spread out!

98
00:08:40,759 --> 00:08:41,679
Three

99
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:44,919
Two

100
00:08:47,879 --> 00:08:48,799
One

101
00:10:01,440 --> 00:10:02,000
Move!

102
00:10:32,480 --> 00:10:33,559
The suspect has a hostage.

103
00:10:33,759 --> 00:10:34,639
Don't do anything rash.

104
00:10:34,759 --> 00:10:35,600
I'll be right there.

105
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:52,960
Xie Guanhong!

106
00:10:58,600 --> 00:10:59,120
Go!

107
00:10:59,120 --> 00:10:59,559
Dad!

108
00:10:59,879 --> 00:11:00,519
Go!

109
00:11:25,840 --> 00:11:27,120
You murderer!

110
00:11:28,200 --> 00:11:29,200
Let him go!
